category: Net
build-depends: cygport libcrypt-devel
sdesc: "RADIUS client library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "FreeRADIUS Client is a framework and library for writing RADIUS Clients which
additionally includes radlogin, a flexible RADIUS aware login replacement, a
command line program to send RADIUS accounting records and a utility to query
the status of a (Merit) RADIUS server."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/FreeRADIUS/freeradius-client
license: BSD-2-Clause
